<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Account Deactivated</title>
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; border-top: 4px solid #dc3545;">
      <h2 style="color: #333;">Goodbye, {{name}}</h2>
      <p>Your account has been successfully deactivated.</p>
      
      <p>We're sorry to see you go. If you have a moment, we'd love to know how we could have made your experience better.</p>
      
      <p style="color: #666; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 30px;">
        If you did not request this deactivation, please secure your account immediately by contacting our support team.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>